<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Second Sight</ansi> mutation

A third awareness opens behind your eyes — you feel a blow forming
before the muscle moves to throw it.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive (Ethereal)
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  You notice anything hidden, your sharpened perception and early
  warning make blows far harder to land on you, and you can hardly be
  ambushed

